# Nothing here may be replayed from a browser's own store without asking first.
#
# On 23 Sep 2026 a refusal from the edge was kept by Chrome and handed back on
# every later visit, with no request ever reaching the server. Clearing site
# settings did not touch it, because that clears cookies and storage, not the
# file cache. no-cache still lets a browser keep its copy. It just has to
# check with us before using it, so a stale refusal can never stick again.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
